{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore the fantastic world of Dark Elves</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After centuries, ancient palm leaf manuscripts known as the \u201cAtnurok\u201d have allegedly been unearthed by a selfish Sorcerer of the undead named Erasmus. These texts are rumored to grant arcane abilities to summon beasts from other realms, capable of immense destruction putting the noble race of the Dokkalfar at risk. The allure of such power is undeniable, and Erasmus has exploited the lower volitions of elves, goblins, trolls, and all creatures alike, who are eager to dominate and control the world at any cost, to join his cult.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Ballads of Vivi the Dark Elf recount the heroic saga of the one who brought this cult to its knees and vanquished the monsters unleashed by the scrolls. Step into the boots of Vivian and embark on this action-adventure RPG, where you will traverse perilous biomes, wield legendary weapons, and harness the shadow magic of the Dokkalfar to conquer true evil. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3093910/extras/0820f31833279c94aafd9d28c4d79829.webp?t=1759221703\" width=620 height=34 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3093910/extras/2d6e0ab14b046bea4b99a55c955a4167.avif?t=1759221703\" width=613 height=647 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3093910/extras/0820f31833279c94aafd9d28c4d79829.webp?t=1759221703\" width=620 height=34 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Classical 2D room-to-room, boss-to-boss progression. Modernized for the current era.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Responsive controls. Dodge, dash and slash through fantastic beasts and monsters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover a dark fantasy world filled with lore, explore secrets in a non linear map</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get to know a whole city of your Dark Elf kin and follow numerous quests and side quests to gain unique spells, weapons, and XP</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forge your own path, build multiple loadouts, collect gear</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use tons of potions, poisons, and elixirs to modify your gameplay. Find ingredients to craft your own!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your time is respected. Minimal death penalties. Fast travel. Modernized QOL.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3093910/extras/0820f31833279c94aafd9d28c4d79829.webp?t=1759221703\" width=620 height=34 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3093910/extras/fbe6c331ad0d375807fcdc681cbfe3ac.poster.avif?t=1759221703\" width=612 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3093910/extras/fbe6c331ad0d375807fcdc681cbfe3ac.webm?t=1759221703\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3093910/extras/fbe6c331ad0d375807fcdc681cbfe3ac.mp4?t=1759221703\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3093910/extras/473655eb25a9dd093e704df4529c75d2.poster.avif?t=17